WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.830
Leave a pan of water
boiling on the hob.

2
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.030
Half an hour later, the
pan is nearly empty.

3
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.970
The water hasn't gone down the drain.

4
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:12.270
It's in the air all around
you, spread out and invisible.

5
00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:15.810
A pan of liquid is now
spread through a whole room.

6
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:19.430
So did the water particles
swell up to fill the space?

7
00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:22.510
And did any of the water's
mass simply vanish?

8
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:26.170
In this mission, you'll compare
how particles are arranged and

9
00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:29.420
how they move in solids,
liquids and gases.

10
00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:33.170
You'll see how adding or removing
energy changes the state,

11
00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:37.030
and whether a change of
state makes a new substance.

12
00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:41.130
Your mission: explain what
really happens to the water.
